{"4233420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bugs with Afterburners", "steam_appid": 4233420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4802040], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/b3ae19b47b8013e1e52e99191ab1e174.poster.avif?t=1781499437\" width=1170 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/b3ae19b47b8013e1e52e99191ab1e174.webm?t=1781499437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/b3ae19b47b8013e1e52e99191ab1e174.mp4?t=1781499437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You are an aphid officer, assigned command of a cutting-edge carrier turtle. Everything you need to operate in enemy territory has been grafted to its innards. Your mission? Turn the tide of the war by destroying the enemy’s infrastructure in a daring mission deep behind their lines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face layered defenses and relentless counterattack. Plan your operations to take advantage of terrain and synergies between your bugs. Victory will require quick thinking and coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/b80ebf4816a1aa1c9159f82f23953c7b.avif?t=1781499437\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras_big/b80ebf4816a1aa1c9159f82f23953c7b.webp?t=1781499437 width=1560 height=452 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jump Into the Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of individual bugs in high-octane dogfights and armored duels. Outflank your enemies using an innovative control scheme for air combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/1437b4bd744810dea014fe5e00610489.poster.avif?t=1781499437\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/1437b4bd744810dea014fe5e00610489.webm?t=1781499437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/1437b4bd744810dea014fe5e00610489.mp4?t=1781499437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be deep in enemy territory, away from friendly supply lines. Gather resources by foraging from the environment, plundering enemy installations, and recycling the bodies of the fallen. Produce the fuel, guns, ammunition, and bugs you need aboard your turtle, but make sure to plan ahead—its facilities are limited! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/cb7ae8b9a8de11e56dfd4fe0c55f56f4.avif?t=1781499437\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras_big/cb7ae8b9a8de11e56dfd4fe0c55f56f4.webp?t=1781499437 width=1560 height=344 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand Your Arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture advanced resources from enemy installations to build new weapons. Push into more heavily defended territory to seize the most complex resources and field the fiercest weapons known to aphidkind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with friends to run the most effective operations possible. Attack on multiple fronts and coordinate your bugs to form the ultimate insect combat force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/0263a5bfdbe1bc706b69b8ab0523122c.avif?t=1781499437\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras_big/0263a5bfdbe1bc706b69b8ab0523122c.webp?t=1781499437 width=1560 height=554 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/b3ae19b47b8013e1e52e99191ab1e174.poster.avif?t=1781499437\" width=1170 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/b3ae19b47b8013e1e52e99191ab1e174.webm?t=1781499437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/b3ae19b47b8013e1e52e99191ab1e174.mp4?t=1781499437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You are an aphid officer, assigned command of a cutting-edge carrier turtle. Everything you need to operate in enemy territory has been grafted to its innards. Your mission? Turn the tide of the war by destroying the enemy’s infrastructure in a daring mission deep behind their lines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face layered defenses and relentless counterattack. Plan your operations to take advantage of terrain and synergies between your bugs. Victory will require quick thinking and coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/b80ebf4816a1aa1c9159f82f23953c7b.avif?t=1781499437\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras_big/b80ebf4816a1aa1c9159f82f23953c7b.webp?t=1781499437 width=1560 height=452 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jump Into the Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of individual bugs in high-octane dogfights and armored duels. Outflank your enemies using an innovative control scheme for air combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/1437b4bd744810dea014fe5e00610489.poster.avif?t=1781499437\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/1437b4bd744810dea014fe5e00610489.webm?t=1781499437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/1437b4bd744810dea014fe5e00610489.mp4?t=1781499437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be deep in enemy territory, away from friendly supply lines. Gather resources by foraging from the environment, plundering enemy installations, and recycling the bodies of the fallen. Produce the fuel, guns, ammunition, and bugs you need aboard your turtle, but make sure to plan ahead—its facilities are limited! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/cb7ae8b9a8de11e56dfd4fe0c55f56f4.avif?t=1781499437\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras_big/cb7ae8b9a8de11e56dfd4fe0c55f56f4.webp?t=1781499437 width=1560 height=344 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand Your Arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture advanced resources from enemy installations to build new weapons. Push into more heavily defended territory to seize the most complex resources and field the fiercest weapons known to aphidkind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with friends to run the most effective operations possible. Attack on multiple fronts and coordinate your bugs to form the ultimate insect combat force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras/0263a5bfdbe1bc706b69b8ab0523122c.avif?t=1781499437\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/extras_big/0263a5bfdbe1bc706b69b8ab0523122c.webp?t=1781499437 width=1560 height=554 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Use wits, tactics, and cybernetic fighter bugs to conquer the marshes! Command battles from your carrier or fly individual bugs in intense dogfights. Play solo or co-op, manage resources, and fight your way to victory for aphid high command.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/2b494528d7f25316723e53da302afc3f08c90708/header.jpg?t=1781499437", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/a44080226e2ed043f5e2d0569056af9c867c1599/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781499437", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233420/a44080226e2ed043f5e2d0569056af9c867c1599/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781499437", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Iris Pro P5